{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerCanonical","lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.observability_q_independent","lean:module:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QArithmetic"],"declarations":157,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.fundamental_regularity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.fundamental_regularity","kind":"theorem","line":680,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L680-L686","doc":"For j = 1/2 with [1/2]_q[3/2]_q ≈ 0.83 (at q = 1.110),\nthe regularity exponent is 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.regularity_exponent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.regularity_exponent","kind":"def","line":669,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L669-L678","doc":"Regularity exponent at the origin: R_j(r) ~ r^{ℓ_j} where\nℓ_j is the smallest integer with ℓ(ℓ+1) ≥ lam_j.\nFor the fundamental mode j = 1/2: ℓ = 1 (linear vanishing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.fusion_half_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.fusion_half_half","kind":"theorem","line":663,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L663-L667","doc":"The Clebsch-Gordan fusion rule: 1/2 ⊗ 1/2 contains j = 0.\nThis is the dominant channel driving anti-parallel annihilation.\nIn dimension terms: 2 × 2 = 1 + 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.leray_angular_dof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.leray_angular_dof","kind":"theorem","line":660,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L660-L661","doc":"The total angular DOF is 1 + 4 + 9 + 16 + 25 = 55. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.angular_dof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.angular_dof","kind":"def","line":658,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L658-L658","doc":"Total angular degrees of freedom: Σ(2j+1)². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.ν_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.ν_pos","kind":"theorem","line":656,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L656-L656","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.ν","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.ν","kind":"def","line":655,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L655-L655","doc":"Classical viscosity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.centrifugal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.centrifugal","kind":"def","line":653,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L653-L653","doc":"Centrifugal eigenvalue lam_j = [j]_q[j+1]_q for each spin. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.num_spins","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.num_spins","kind":"def","line":651,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L651-L651","doc":"Number of active spins (j = 0, 1/2, 1, 3/2, 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile.mk","kind":"ctor","line":649,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L649-L649","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.TruncatedLerayProfile","kind":"structure","line":634,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L634-L658","doc":"**Truncated Leray profile data**: the self-similar blowup\nprofile restricted to spins j = 0, 1/2, 1, 3/2, 2.\nThe angular part is fixed by SU_q(2) matrix coefficients;\nonly the 5 radial functions R_j(r) are free.\n\nThis is the *data* the proposition is stated over, not the\nproposition. The LaTeX label for `prop:leray-profile` was carried\nhere — written out in full, it would register this docstring as a\nsecond owner, so it is named indirectly — and has been moved to\n`QOU.FluidDynamics.leray_profile`\n(`QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean`) — the declaration\n`fluid-dynamics/leray-profile.ts` actually references, and whose own\ndocstring already named the block in prose. Bean `qou-szd6`: the\nlabel sat on a superseded carrier while the block pointed elsewhere,\nso nothing connected the block to its real formalisation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.kummer_persists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.kummer_persists","kind":"theorem","line":628,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L628-L628","doc":"Topological obstruction persists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.blowup_finite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.blowup_finite","kind":"theorem","line":626,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L626-L626","doc":"Blowup time is finite. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.vortex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.vortex","kind":"def","line":624,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L624-L624","doc":"Anti-parallel vortex pair data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.obs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.obs","kind":"def","line":622,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L622-L622","doc":"Observability (q-independent). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.chi_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.chi_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":620,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L620-L620","doc":"χ ≠ 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.chi","kind":"def","line":618,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L618-L618","doc":"Euler characteristic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes.mk","kind":"ctor","line":616,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L616-L616","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSSingularityDescartes","kind":"structure","line":602,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L602-L628","doc":"**NS-singularity theorem** for the Descartes universe.\n\nThe logical chain:\n(1) Observability Hom(1, Ad(A)) = 0 — base property, q-independent\n(2) ⟹ Levi form non-degenerate (archimedean image)\n(3) ⟹ Core aspect ratio bounded\n(4) ⟹ Vorticity ‖ω‖ ≥ c/(T*-t) (Biot-Savart)\n(5) ⟹ BKM integral diverges ⟹ blowup\n\nAdditionally: topological obstruction κ₀ = e(ξ) with χ(A) = -6\nsurvives Kummer specialisation (2κ ∤ -6 for κ ≥ 4).\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{thm:ns-singularity-descartes}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.topological_obstruction_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.topological_obstruction_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":569,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L569-L577","doc":"Corollary: for all κ ≥ 4, the topological obstruction\nκ₀ mod 2κ ≠ 0 in H²(S, G_m)/2κ.  The obstruction survives\nspecialisation to the root of unity q = e^{iπ/κ}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.obstruction_persists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.obstruction_persists","kind":"theorem","line":557,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L557-L567","doc":"For κ ≥ 4, 2κ does not divide -6.\nThis is the key arithmetic: |2κ| ≥ 8 > 6 = |-6|.\nRef: [leitner2026] Ch 5 §8 Kummer specialisation ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_euler_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_euler_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":553,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L553-L555","doc":"χ(A) ≠ 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_euler","kind":"def","line":550,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L550-L551","doc":"χ(A) = -6 for the Descartes universe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.jet_exponent_increasing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.jet_exponent_increasing","kind":"theorem","line":540,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L540-L544","doc":"The jet divergence exponent grows with level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.antiparallel_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.antiparallel_obstruction","kind":"def","line":528,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L528-L538","doc":"For the anti-parallel pair at level n ≥ 1, the jet\ndivergence exponent is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.analytic_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.analytic_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":526,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L526-L526","doc":"Analytic contribution nonzero when jets diverge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.jet_exponent_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.jet_exponent_eq","kind":"theorem","line":524,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L524-L524","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.jet_divergence_exponent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.jet_divergence_exponent","kind":"def","line":523,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L523-L523","doc":"Jet divergence rate: |j^n v| ~ 1/(T*-t)^{(n+1)/2}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.linking_number_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.linking_number_pos","kind":"theorem","line":521,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L521-L521","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.linking_number","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.linking_number","kind":"def","line":520,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L520-L520","doc":"Linking number of the filament pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.euler_contribution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.euler_contribution","kind":"def","line":518,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L518-L518","doc":"Euler class contribution (topological). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.level","kind":"def","line":516,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L516-L516","doc":"Tower level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":514,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L514-L514","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.NSObstructionLevel","kind":"structure","line":510,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L510-L526","doc":"**NS obstruction at level n**: the restriction of κ_n to Σ.\nNonzero iff the QOU is NS-singular at that level.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:ns-obstruction-tower}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_boundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.descartes_boundary","kind":"def","line":503,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L503-L508","doc":"For χ(A) = -6 (Descartes/Bring), the Euler class is non-torsion\nand the NS obstruction persists at all Kummer levels κ ≥ 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.ns_singular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.ns_singular","kind":"theorem","line":490,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L490-L490","doc":"NS-singular: obstruction persists (Kummer non-divisibility). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.euler_char_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.euler_char_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":488,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L488-L488","doc":"χ(A) ≠ 0 (non-trivial topology). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.euler_char","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.euler_char","kind":"def","line":486,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L486-L486","doc":"Euler characteristic χ(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability.mk","kind":"ctor","line":484,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L484-L484","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BoundaryObservability","kind":"structure","line":470,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L470-L490","doc":"**Boundary observability**: the limit of Hom(1, Ad(A_q)) as q → 1.\nPer owner decision Q-VO9T-2 = 1 (2026-11-15, beans `qou-nzyr`, `qou-hjl0`,\nmatching `QOU.FluidDynamics.qou_ns_in_qou`), the NS obstruction `NS(A)` is\nthe **global** surface Euler class `e(ξ) ∈ H²(S, ℤ) ≅ ℤ` of degree\n`euler_char = χ(A)` (not the curve restriction `e(ξ)|_Σ`, which vanishes\nidentically by `thm:ns-singularity-descartes` item 3).\nA quantum universe is Categorically NS-regular iff `euler_char = 0` and\nCategorically NS-singular iff `euler_char ≠ 0` (`euler_char_ne_zero`);\n`ns_singular` additionally records the Kummer root-obstruction `2κ ∤ χ(A)`\nat all levels `κ ≥ 4` (`thm:ns-singularity-descartes` item 2).\nThese labels are internal categorical properties of `(𝐂, A, τ)` (framework\nmodel correspondence, not a deductive classical 3D PDE theorem).\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:ns-regular-qou}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:ns-regular-qou","label":"def:ns-regular-qou","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/ns-regular-qou.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.q_bkm_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.q_bkm_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":459,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L459-L464","doc":"q-BKM is trivial for q > 1: ℏ_q > 0 gives finite vorticity.\nRef: [beale-kato-majda1984] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01212349 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.quantum_peter_weyl_completeness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.quantum_peter_weyl_completeness","kind":"theorem","line":440,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L440-L453","doc":"**Quantum Peter–Weyl completeness.**\nThe matrix coefficients {D^j_{mn}} form a complete orthonormal\nbasis of L²(A).\n\nThis is an axiom of the formalization.  It is justified by\nTannaka–Krein reconstruction: the fibre functor τ (faithful,\nexact, monoidal — a QOU axiom) gives A ≅ ⊕_j End(τ(V_j)),\nwhich is spanned by the matrix coefficients.\n\nRef: [woronowicz1987] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01219077\nRef: [leitner2026] Ch 5 §8 Quantum Peter-Weyl theorem ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.eigenspace_dim_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.eigenspace_dim_pos","kind":"theorem","line":436,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L436-L438","doc":"Eigenspace dimension is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.eigenspace_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.eigenspace_dim","kind":"def","line":432,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L432-L434","doc":"The eigenspace dimension for spin j is (2j+1)².\nRef: [woronowicz1987] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01219077 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.q_dim_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.q_dim_pos","kind":"theorem","line":430,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L430-L430","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.q_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.q_dim","kind":"def","line":429,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L429-L429","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.n_idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.n_idx","kind":"def","line":428,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L428-L428","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.m_idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.m_idx","kind":"def","line":427,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L427-L427","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.twice_j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.twice_j","kind":"def","line":426,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L426-L426","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient.mk","kind":"ctor","line":425,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L425-L425","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.MatrixCoefficient","kind":"structure","line":423,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L423-L430","doc":"Matrix coefficient D^j_{mn}: eigenfunction of Δ_q with\neigenvalue [j]_q[j+1]_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.antiParallelVortexBlowup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.antiParallelVortexBlowup","kind":"def","line":410,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L410-L417","doc":"The anti-parallel vortex pair candidate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.dim_consistent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.dim_consistent","kind":"theorem","line":408,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L408-L408","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.level_gt_sobolev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.level_gt_sobolev","kind":"theorem","line":407,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L407-L407","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.sobolev_exponent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.sobolev_exponent","kind":"def","line":406,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L406-L406","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.linking_number","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.linking_number","kind":"def","line":405,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L405-L405","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.hausdorff_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.hausdorff_dim","kind":"def","line":404,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L404-L404","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.level","kind":"def","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L403-L403","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":402,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L402-L402","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.BlowupObstruction","kind":"structure","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L401-L408","doc":"Blowup obstruction data (from §14). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.bernstein_bound_linear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.bernstein_bound_linear","kind":"theorem","line":396,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L396-L399","doc":"The Bernstein bound grows linearly with κ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.bernstein_bound_ge_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.bernstein_bound_ge_one","kind":"theorem","line":389,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L389-L394","doc":"The Bernstein bound is ≥ 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond_le_bernstein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond_le_bernstein","kind":"theorem","line":387,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L387-L387","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.bernstein_bound_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.bernstein_bound_eq","kind":"theorem","line":386,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L386-L386","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.bernstein_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.bernstein_bound","kind":"def","line":385,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L385-L385","doc":"Upper bound: cond ≤ 1 + C(κ-1) (Bernstein inequality). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond_ge_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond_ge_one","kind":"theorem","line":383,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L383-L383","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.max_cond","kind":"def","line":382,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L382-L382","doc":"Maximum condition number over the evolution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.κ_ge_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.κ_ge_two","kind":"theorem","line":380,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L380-L380","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.κ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.κ","kind":"def","line":379,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L379-L379","doc":"Truncation level (κ in q = e^{iπ/κ}). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":377,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L377-L377","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviDegeneracyConjecture","kind":"structure","line":369,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L369-L387","doc":"**Levi degeneracy conjecture**: the core aspect ratio at root of\nunity q = e^{iπ/κ} grows at most linearly in κ.\n\nThe NS millennium problem reduces to determining the growth rate:\n- If cond = O(1): blowup (counter-example established)\n- If cond ~ κ: regularity (Levi form degenerates)\n\nRef: [leitner2026] Ch 5 §8 Root-of-unity truncation ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.q_bounded_cond_finite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.q_bounded_cond_finite","kind":"theorem","line":360,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L360-L363","doc":"The q-bounded condition number is finite. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.cond_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.cond_bound","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L358-L358","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.hbar_q_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.hbar_q_pos","kind":"theorem","line":357,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L357-L357","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.hbar_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.hbar_q","kind":"def","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L356-L356","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L355-L355","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.toLeviFormNormalPlane","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm.toLeviFormNormalPlane","kind":"def","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L355-L358","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.QBoundedLeviForm","kind":"structure","line":354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L354-L358","doc":"For q > 1, quantum pressure bounds cond by 1 + ℏ_q². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.levi_cond_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.levi_cond_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":333,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L333-L352","doc":"cond = 1 iff λ_∥ = λ_⊥ (isotropic core). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.levi_cond_ge_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.levi_cond_ge_one","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L325-L331","doc":"cond ≥ 1 (equality iff isotropic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviFormNormalPlane.cond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviFormNormalPlane.cond","kind":"def","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.lean#L321-L323","doc":"Condition number: max(λ_∥/λ_⊥, λ_⊥/λ_∥). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviFormNormalPlane.lam_perp_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GaugeFieldFluidDynamics.LeviFormNormalPlane.lam_perp_pos","kind":"theorem","line":319,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5